# No browser actions

Do not open, drive, inspect, or screenshot the app with browser tools. This includes Cursor browser tabs, snapshots, clicks, typing, CDP, screenshots, and lock/unlock.

Verify UI another way when needed (types, tests, a local render check) and say that the browser was not used.

```text
❌ browser_navigate, browser_snapshot, browser_click, browser_cdp, browser_take_screenshot
✅ read the component, typecheck, describe what was not checked in a browser
```
